Article 24

1. Related parties as referred to in Article 23 paragraph (2) are:a. social community organizations, institutions or orphanages that have activities related to the protection, care, accommodation, guidance, empowerment of Children and/or Women;
b. social workers or volunteers;
c. advocates; andd. religious leaders.
2. Cooperation as referred to in Article 23 paragraph (2) is carried out in the form of a cooperation agreement.

